  "description": "Schema-driven Dynamic Data Grid for Syncfusion Blazor SfGrid.\n\t\t\tGenerates columns and behavior from JSON-based schemas (Items JSON Schema, Table UI Schema, Translation Schema).\n\t\t\tConfigure filters, widths, alignment, initial ordering, and localization via schema.\n\t\t\tSupports paging/virtualization and custom data retrieval through DataAdaptor (incl. JTokenDataAdaptor + IDynamicGridDataProvider).",
